---
alwaysApply: true
---

• Read `Readme.md`: Main Ideas, installed apps
• Per app, always read **both**:
  - `{app}/README.md` + `{app}/docs/` — reusable - global docs (deploy, SSO, scripts)
  - `instance/{app}/Readme.md` — this Instance's docs (eg ports, HostPath, Authentik slug...)
  - Secrets: `instance/{app}/.env`, `instance/{app}/.env.oidc`
• Shared secrets: `instance/caddy/.env` (domains/upstreams), `instance/email/.env` (SMTP), `instance/truenas/.env` (TrueNAS API)
• Global (all instances): `docs/`, `workflows/`
• Agent skills: custom in `.cursor/skills/`; `npx skills` installs in `.agents/skills/` (lock: `skills-lock.json`)

# Documentation Creation

• Instance-specific → `instance/{app}/` (this hardware, ports, datasets, live Authentik)
• Reusable app docs → `{app}/docs/` (same on every instance)
• Cross-app / legal / install guide → `docs/`

# all scripts must be generic-reusable

• `{app}/scripts` uses input and/or `instance/{app}/` data
- so scripts work on different instances with different settings
